1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,072
The most famous ghost ship in history did not sink in a storm.

2
00:00:04,292 --> 00:00:05,820
Her own captain crashed her.

3
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:06,930
On purpose.

4
00:00:07,430 --> 00:00:19,029
In eighteen eighty five, Captain Gilman Parker loaded the Mary Celeste with mostly worthless cargo, insured it for thirty thousand dollars, and ran her onto a reef near Haiti.

5
00:00:20,429 --> 00:00:21,274
He was caught.

6
00:00:21,494 --> 00:00:24,945
The trial collapsed, but the shippers had to pay the money back.

7
00:00:25,445 --> 00:00:31,336
So the ship that survived a mystery at sea could not survive a guy with an insurance policy.

8
00:00:32,736 --> 00:00:35,718
Follow for more true stories history never finished.
